+<body>
+  <h1>🧭 Pathfinding &amp; Maze Visualizer</h1>
+  <p class="sub">Draw walls, drag start/end, generate a maze, then watch BFS, DFS, Dijkstra, A*, and Bidirectional BFS explore the grid in real time. Pure vanilla JS, zero dependencies.</p>
